\par \noindent 11.【解析】已知 $\alpha ,\beta $ 为锐角，$\tan \alpha =\frac {1}{7}$，$\sin \beta =\frac {\sqrt {10}}{10}$，求 $\alpha +2\beta $。 \\ 先求 $\tan \beta $、$\tan 2\beta $，再由和角公式求 $\tan (\alpha +2\beta )$，最后用角的范围确定 $\alpha +2\beta $。 \\ \begin {align*} \cos \beta &=\sqrt {1-\sin ^2\beta }=\frac {3\sqrt {10}}{10} \\ \tan \beta &=\frac {\sqrt {10}}{10}\div \frac {3\sqrt {10}}{10}=\frac {1}{3} \\ \tan 2\beta &=\frac {2}{3}\div \left (1-\frac {1}{9}\right )=\frac {2}{3}\times \frac {9}{8}=\frac {3}{4} \\ \tan (\alpha +2\beta )&=\left (\frac {1}{7}+\frac {3}{4}\right )\div \left (1-\frac {1}{7}\times \frac {3}{4}\right )=\frac {25}{28}\div \frac {25}{28}=1 \\ 0<\alpha <\frac {\pi }{4},\ 0<\beta <\frac {\pi }{4}&\Rightarrow 0<\alpha +2\beta <\frac {3\pi }{4} \\ &\Rightarrow \alpha +2\beta =\frac {\pi }{4} \end {align*} 故选 B。\par \vspace *{1ex}
